        <mxCell id="legend_notes" value="What's deliberately not on this diagram:&#10;&#10;• WAF on the ALB (Wave 3 — audit M4/M5)&#10;• VPC endpoints for SM/ECR/Logs/S3 (Wave 2 — audit M1)&#10;• GuardDuty / CloudTrail / AWS Config (Wave 3 — audit M26/M27)&#10;• GitHub Actions OIDC for CI deploys (audit M8)&#10;• ECS auto-scaling target on CPU/mem (Wave 2)&#10;• RDS read replica (Wave 2)&#10;• Cross-account / cross-region backup (Wave 2)&#10;&#10;Why: Wave 1 of the audit is what shipped in PR&#35;12. The above are tracked in docs/aws-prod-readiness-audit.md and land in subsequent PRs." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8DC;strokeColor=#B8860B;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top" vertex="1" parent="legend">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="340" width="320" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="legend_rps" value="Per-PR provenance:&#10;&#10;• PR &#35;12 — every AWS resource and security boundary on this page (Multi-AZ RDS, replicated ElastiCache, KMS, Secrets Manager, HTTPS-only ALB, scoped IAM, S3 bucket, CW logs, TF state stack)&#10;&#10;• PR &#35;9 — multi-agent orchestrator (lives inside the ECS backend tasks; see Page 2)&#10;&#10;• PR &#35;10 — multimodal chat (org-scoped reads from S3 uploads bucket)&#10;&#10;• PR &#35;11 — voice push-to-talk (frontend on Vercel; backend voice endpoints in the ECS backend tasks)&#10;&#10;• PR &#35;8 — observability picks (Grafana / Sentry / Langfuse / OnCall on the bottom band)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E5F5E5;strokeColor=#2E7D32;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top" vertex="1" parent="legend">
